  "description": "For those who glide through the city with ease but crave something a little wilder come the weekend, meet Novus. Built for the urban jungle but ready to roam free, this is the ebike that takes you far beyond your morning coffee run. With a Bosch Performance Line motor and a generous 600wh battery, Novus delivers up to 83 miles of seamless, assisted riding. Off-road tyres and a front suspension fork with 100mm travel shrug off potholes and gravel tracks alike. Mudguards, lights, and a 25kg rear rack handle the practicalities, so you don’t have to. The details are considered: comfort grips, a Selle Royal Essenza saddle, and your choice of crossbar or step-through frame. Whether you’re loading up for a countryside ramble or just cutting through traffic, it’s a ride that makes light work of heavy miles. In a world of routine, Novus is your elegant excuse to break it. No noise, no fuss – just pure, quiet capability. Range Calculator Use this calculator to better estimate the range you might achieve based on your riding conditions: Bosch Ebike Calculator (Please check the specification to ensure your select the correct motor and battery. The total travel distance will depend on the capacity of the battery, rider and luggage weight, power mode setting and riding style.) Important Please be aware that this bike is regulated in line with existing Electric Power Assisted Cycles regulations. Any modification to the bike will invalidate the guarantee and in particular any modification which increases the power of the motor and/or the top assisted speed of the bike may make the rider liable to prosecution. Excluding statutory obligations Raleigh will not be held responsible for any injuries incurred following any modification to this product.",
